# Topic ACL. Device username == nodeID, so one pattern scopes every device to its own subtree.
# Platform (Node-RED): reads all node + hub traffic, publishes only under platform/.
user nodered
topic read farm/+/node/+/#
topic read farm/+/hub/#
topic readwrite farm/+/platform/#

# Raspberry Pi hub: its own subtree, plus republishing RF readings onto node topics.
user hub
topic readwrite farm/+/hub/#
topic write farm/+/node/+/#
topic read farm/+/platform/#

# Sensor nodes (esp32 node01, simulator sim01, ...): may touch only farm/<site>/node/<own username>/#
pattern readwrite farm/+/node/%u/#

# Simulator control channel
user sim01
topic readwrite farm/demo/sim/#
